<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2796] NPE during rebalancing</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2796</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This exception sometimes appear in logs when topology changes under load:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
